So instead of repeating what's wrong with other frameworks, let me show you how Tanstack Start actually solves these problems.

60
00:05:30,464 --> 00:05:32,164
这归结为四件事。
It comes down to four things.

61
00:05:32,590 --> 00:05:35,396
客户端优先，但具备完整的服务端能力。
Client side first, but fully server capable.

62
00:05:35,744 --> 00:05:43,364
你的组件会在服务器上渲染并在浏览器中水合，开箱即用，支持状态和事件处理程序。
So your components render on the server and hydrate in the browser, ready for state and event handlers out of the box.

63
00:05:43,758 --> 00:05:54,052
这意味着你不需要在到处强制管理严格的客户端与服务器边界。所以不需要在组件文件顶部使用 "use client" 指令，也不需要在服务端操作中使用 "use server"。
Which means that you're not forced to manage strict client-server boundaries everywhere. So no use client directives on top of your component files or use server on your server actions.

64
00:05:54,478 --> 00:05:57,764
你的 React 组件就是普通的 React 组件。
Your React components are just React components.

65
00:05:58,144 --> 00:06:02,756
服务端工作发生在路由层面，而不是在你的 JSX 内部。
Server work happens at the route level, not inside of your JSX.

66
00:06:02,944 --> 00:06:06,756
此外，还有从数据库到组件的类型安全的路由。
Also, type safe routing from database to component.

67
00:06:07,086 --> 00:06:15,024
因为它基于 TanStack Router 构建，它会自动将服务器上的数据库类型直接连接到前端的 React 代码中。
Because it's built on Tanstack Router, it automatically connects your database types on the server straight to your React code on the front end.

68
00:06:15,438 --> 00:06:21,700
所以如果你更改了一个数据库查询，如果出现问题，你的编辑器会立即显示红线提醒。
So if you change a database query, your editor will instantly show you a red line if something breaks.

69
00:06:21,966 --> 00:06:27,264
它是端到端的完美类型安全，而这在 Next.js 中默认是不提供的。
It's perfectly type safe end-to-end, and you don't get that from Next.js by default.

70
