Major infrastructure players like Cloudflare, Netlify, Clerk, and Neon are actively partnering with Tanstack to make it a first class way to build for the web,

87
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:05,584
这意味着你正在学习最正确的工具，而且正是时候。
which means that you're learning exactly the right tool at exactly the right time.

88
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:08,868
让我来展示一下这一切是如何结合在一起的。
So let me show you how all of this actually comes together.

89
00:08:11,438 --> 00:08:17,476
让我们追踪一下当用户在浏览器中输入你的 URL 并按下回车时，到底发生了什么。
Let's trace exactly what happens when a user types your URL into the browser and hits enter.

90
00:08:18,222 --> 00:08:27,556
我知道你来这里是为了写代码，而不是听关于 HTTP 的讲解，但这是解释你以后会遇到的每一个奇怪 Bug 的核心模型。
I know you came here to write code, not listen about HTTP, but this is the one mental model that explains every weird bug you'll hit later.

91
00:08:28,048 --> 00:08:34,884
为什么你的加载器运行了两次，为什么数据在服务端显示但在客户端不显示，或者为什么水合报错了。
Why your loader ran twice, why your data showed up on the server but not on the client, or why the hydration broke.

92
00:08:35,278 --> 00:08:37,924
在这里花 10 分钟能帮你节省后续构建中的数小时。
10 minutes here saves you hours in the build.

93
00:08:38,284 --> 00:08:38,847
那我们开始吧。
So let's go.

94
00:08:39,008 --> 00:08:42,275
浏览器向你的服务器发送一个 HTTP get 请求。
The browser sends an HTTP get request to your server.

95
00:08:42,702 --> 00:08:48,068
这个请求到达了 TanStack Start 服务器，它底层实际上是运行在 Node 之上的。
That request hits the Tanstack Start server, which is actually running Node under the hood.

96
00:08:48,814 --> 00:08:56,368
Start 查看 URL，将其与你的路由树进行匹配，并确定该 URL 下哪些路由处于激活状态。
Start looks up at the URL, matches it against your route tree, and figures out which routes are active for that URL.

97
00:08:56,558 --> 00:08:59,716
假设 URL 是 skills TanStackQuery。
Let's say the URL is skills TanstackQuery.

98
00:09:00,048 --> 00:09:08,964
Start 识别出这匹配了一个带有动态参数的路由，并且它位于一个父级布局路由内，这两个都是激活状态。
Start sees that this matches a route with a dynamic param and that it lives inside of a parent layout route, both of which are active.

99
00:09:09,454 --> 00:09:11,716
现在，Start 开始运行加载器。
Now, Start runs the loaders.

100
00:09:11,982 --> 00:09:16,804
加载器是绑定到特定路由上的专用数据获取函数。
A loader is a dedicated data fetching function attached to a specific route.

101
00:09:17,262 --> 00:09:26,276
它在 URL 改变时立即运行，在 React 组件开始渲染之前就获取该页面所需的数据。
It runs exactly when the URL changes, fetching the data required for that page before the React component even begins to render.

102
00:09:26,448 --> 00:09:35,428
加载器是你与数据库交互、调用 API 或执行任何为了生成页面所需数据的工作的地方。
The loaders are where you talk to your database, call your APIs, or do whatever work is needed to produce the data your page requires.

103
00:09:35,822 --> 00:09:41,568
如果加载器之间没有依赖关系，Start 可以并行运行它们，这对性能非常重要。
Start can run loaders in parallel if they don't depend on each other, which matters for performance.

104
00:09:41,774 --> 00:09:50,048
我会在接下来的课程中深入讲解加载器，但目前你只需要知道它们在服务器上运行，在渲染之前运行，
I'll go deep on loaders in the upcoming lessons, but for now just understand that they run on the server, they run before rendering,

105
00:09:50,448 --> 00:09:52,132
并且它们产出数据。
and they produce data.

106
00:09:52,814 --> 00:09:58,148
一旦加载器解析完成，Start 就会在服务器上渲染你的 React 组件树。
Once the loaders have resolved, Start renders your React component tree on the server.

107
00:09:58,606 --> 00:10:04,452
它调用你的根组件，渲染布局，再渲染页面，一直向下传递。
It calls your root component, which renders the layout, which renders the page, all the way down.

108
00:10:04,942 --> 00:10:09,156
这是标准的 React 渲染，只不过是运行在 Node 而不是浏览器中。
This is normal React rendering, just running in Node instead of a browser.

109
00:10:09,838 --> 00:10:12,036
输出结果是一个 HTML 字符串。
