00:10:50,542 --> 00:11:01,092
TanStack router 会拦截链接点击，将下一个路由的加载器作为 API 调用运行，更新 React 树，浏览器永远不会进行全页面刷新。
Tanstack router intercepts the link click, runs the next route's loader as an API call, updates the React tree, and the browser never does a full page reload.

119
00:11:01,422 --> 00:11:04,356
用户获得了快速的、类似原生应用的导航体验。
