因为如果你跳过这一步，Firebase 会去寻找 alt 示例文件夹，从而找不到你的新查询。
Because if you skip this, Firebase will look for the alt example folder and fail to find your new query.

1942
02:55:11,118 --> 02:55:13,796
所以简单地将其修改为 connectors。
So simply modify it to connectors.

1943
