然后我们想使用全局安装的 Firebase 来部署这个新查询。
Then we want to deploy this new query using globally installed Firebase.

1944
02:55:18,862 --> 02:55:27,076
你可以通过 MPX 来完成，只需输入 Firebase deploy --only data connect
You can do that through MPX by simply typing Firebase deploy dash dash only data connect

1945
02:55:27,248 --> 02:55:27,716
就像这样。
like this.

1946
02:55:28,270 --> 02:55:34,848
所以当你部署时，你实际上是在 Firebase 服务器上注册你的 .gql 文件。
So when you deploy, you're actually registering your .gql files on the Firebase server.

1947
02:55:34,958 --> 02:55:41,188
这意味着你的生产数据库会拒绝运行任何尚未部署的查询。
And this means that your production database refuses to run any queries that aren't already deployed.

1948
02:55:41,614 --> 02:55:47,968
如果黑客试图向你的后端发送自定义的 GraphQL 字符串，服务器就会直接报错说它不认识这个请求。
So if a hacker tries to send a custom GraphQL string to your backend, the server simply says, I don't know what that is.

1949
02:55:48,174 --> 02:55:51,940
这就是为什么在编写任何查询或变更后，我们需要进行部署。
And that's why we need to deploy after writing any queries or mutation.

1950
02:55:52,174 --> 02:55:54,448
现在我们可以看到部署已完成。
